    {
      "id": "belts",
      "title": "Bring the plates home",
      "body": "An Inserter (2) grabs items from the tile behind it and drops them in front. Place one below the furnace facing south, then lay Belts (1) along the marked path into the Nexus.\n\nTip: hold the left mouse button and drag to lay a line of belts. Hold Shift to keep the blueprint selected.",
