      "body": "Iron plates are flowing into the Nexus. Watch the Iron Plate count in the top right. Everything you build is paid from that storage, so a growing factory means more defenses.\n\nLeft-click any building to select it. Its actions (rotate, repair, deconstruct) appear on the command card.",
